gh text.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="2" w:name="_Toc100001"/><w:r><w:t>Background</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="2"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Every converter must decide how a paragraph flows across lines, columns and pages. Typography rewards patience: kerning, leading and measure shape how a reader moves through text. A document is a tree of sections, paragraphs and runs, each with properties inherited from styles.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="3" w:name="_Toc100002"/><w:r><w:t>Scope</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="3"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Typography rewards patience: kerning, leading and measure shape how a reader moves through text. A document is a tree of sections, paragraphs and runs, each with properties inherited from styles. Tables carry structure that prose cannot, and their borders resolve conflicts by weight and style.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:br w:type="page"/></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="4" w:name="_Toc100003"/><w:r><w:t>Method</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="4"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>A document is a tree of sections, paragraphs and runs, each with properties inherited from styles. Tables carry structure that prose cannot, and their borders resolve conflicts by weight and style. Fields cache their last result so a consumer that cannot evaluate them still shows something useful.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="5" w:name="_Toc100004"/><w:r><w:t>Data</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="5"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Tables carry structure that prose cannot, and their borders resolve conflicts by weight and style. Fields cache their last result so a consumer that cannot evaluate them still shows something useful. Pictures anchor to paragraphs, float beside text, and wrap it along their bounding box or contour.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading3"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="6" w:name="_Toc100005"/><w:r><w:t>Sources</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="6"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Fields cache their last result so a consumer that cannot evaluate them still shows something useful. Pictures anchor to paragraphs, float beside text, and wrap it along their bounding box or contour. Footnotes collect at the bottom of the page that references them, below a short separator line.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading3"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="7" w:name="_Toc100006"/><w:r><w:t>Cleaning</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="7"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Pictures anchor to paragraphs, float beside text, and wrap it along their bounding box or contour. Footnotes collect at the bottom of the page that references them, below a short separator line. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:br w:type="page"/></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="8" w:name="_Toc100007"/><w:r><w:t>Results</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="8"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Footnotes collect at the bottom of the page that references them, below a short separator line. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures. Every converter must decide how a paragraph flows across lines, columns and pages.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:bookmarkStart w:id="9" w:name="_Toc100008"/><w:r><w:t>Discussion</w:t></w:r><w:bookmarkEnd w:id="9"/></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures. Every converter must decide how a paragraph flows across lines, columns and pages. Typography rewards patience: kerning, leading and measure shape how a reader moves through text.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:sectPr><w:pgSz w:w="12240" w:h="15840"/><w:pgMar w:top="1440" w:right="1440" w:bo